\pard\sa120 "FloServer" means the FloServer program for Windows: the window, the background service, the flo and floserver commands, its installer and updates, and its documentation. FloServer is free, closed-source software: a native desktop application written in C++. It sets up and runs a local web development environment on your own computer.\par
\pard\sa120 By installing or using FloServer, you accept this Agreement. If you don't accept it, don't install or use FloServer. If you accept it for a company or another organisation, you confirm that you may do so on its behalf.\par
