\pard\sa120\sb240\b 6. What FloServer changes on your computer\b0\par
\pard\sa120 FloServer installs for your Windows user only and needs no administrator rights. To do its job it:\par
\pard\sa60\li360\fi-200 \bullet  puts its programs in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\FloServer, and its runtimes, settings and databases in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\FloServer;\par
\pard\sa60\li360\fi-200 \bullet  adds its command folder and its terminal commands (php, node, composer, python and others) to your user's Path;\par
\pard\sa60\li360\fi-200 \bullet  creates a local certificate authority and, after Windows asks you, adds it to your user's trusted certificates, so your projects open on https. It can only vouch for localhost addresses, and its private key never leaves your computer;\par
\pard\sa60\li360\fi-200 \bullet  runs web servers and databases that listen on your computer only (127.0.0.1), on ports such as 80, 443, 8080 and 3306;\par
\pard\sa60\li360\fi-200 \bullet  starts when you sign in to Windows, if you turn that on in Settings.\par
\pard\sa120 Uninstalling FloServer from Windows removes its programs, its Path entries, its start-up entry and its certificate authority. Your projects, databases and downloaded runtimes stay until you delete them, for example with Remove FloServer... in Settings.\par
\pard\sa120\sb240\b 7. Privacy and internet connections\b0\par
\pard\sa120 FloServer collects no personal data and sends no usage statistics, crash reports or telemetry. Your projects, code and databases stay on your computer.\par
\pard\sa120 FloServer connects to the internet only to:\par
\pard\sa60\li360\fi-200 \bullet  download the signed list of runtimes and app updates from cdn.floserver.org, once a day and when you ask;\par
\pard\sa60\li360\fi-200 \bullet  download the runtimes and templates you choose, from cdn.floserver.org or, if that fails, from each project's official site;\par
\pard\sa60\li360\fi-200 \bullet  open links you click, such as floserver.org, in your browser.\par
\pard\sa120 Those servers see what any web server sees, such as your IP address and the file requested, as described in https://floserver.org/privacy/. If HostKurd ever offers crash reports, they will be off until you turn them on.\par
\pard\sa120\sb240\b 8. Updates and future paid versions\b0\par
\pard\sa120 FloServer checks for new versions once a day and tells you when one is ready. It installs an update only when you click Update. Updates are covered by this Agreement unless they come with new terms, which FloServer shows you before installing.\par
\pard\sa120 FloServer is free today. HostKurd may later offer paid editions or paid features. If it does, the version you already have keeps working under this Agreement, and nothing you use for free today will start costing money without you agreeing first.\par
