\pard\sa120 FloServer is made for developing and testing on your own computer. It is not made to host live websites or to serve the public, and its servers are set up for convenience, not for the internet.\par
\pard\sa120 FloServer is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranty of any kind. To the extent the law allows, HostKurd disclaims all warranties, express or implied, including that it is fit for a particular purpose, free of errors or uninterrupted. Keep backups of your projects and databases.\par
